--TEST--
`prepareRename` on the `is` keyword of a type test is refused, because a keyword is no symbol, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
interface Shape
{
    public function area(): int;
}

class Square implements Shape
{
    public function area(): int { return 4; }
}

mixed $s = new Square();
if ($s i<|>s Shape) {
    echo $s->area();
}
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
